# No em or en dashes

Never use Unicode em dash (U+2014) or en dash (U+2013) anywhere in this project: UI strings, code, comments, XML, docs, or commits.

Use instead:

- ASCII hyphen-minus `-` for ranges and simple separators (`1-3`, `slot1-slot8`)
- Comma, period, colon, or parentheses for prose breaks
- ASCII `-` for empty UI placeholders

Do not reintroduce these characters when editing or generating text.
